      "audio_url": "les_01_02_dialogue_2_nice_to_meet_you_kev.mp3"
    },
    {
      "role": "B",
      "text_en": "Nice to meet you too, Sarah.",
      "text_zh": "我也很高兴见到你，萨拉。",
      "audio_url": "les_01_02_dialogue_3_nice_to_meet_you_too.mp3"
    },
    {
      "role": "A",
      "text_en": "Are you a new student?",
      "text_zh": "你是新学生吗？",
      "audio_url": "les_01_02_dialogue_4_are_you_a_new_studen.mp3"
    },
    {
      "role": "B",
      "text_en": "Yes, I am.",
      "text_zh": "是的，我是。",
      "audio_url": "les_01_02_dialogue_5_yes_i_am.mp3"
    },
    {
      "role": "A",
      "text_en": "Can you spell your name?",
